## 4.12 DDR5继承与DDR6修改关系

**表4-3 前端模块继承与修改关系**

| DDR5设计内容 | DDR6处理 | 收敛后的处理原则 |
|---|---|---|
| Host Port Arbitration | KEEP/MODIFY | 保留现有Port、QoS和Priority机制 |
| HIF Request Path | MODIFY | 形成Whole Request及Logical Transaction |
| Parent/Child | NEW / OPTIONAL | DDR6设计新增机制，最新版降级为条件启用 |
| Token/Index Identity | REVIEW/MODIFY | 按真实ABA风险决定是否增加Generation |
| WDATA Pointer/Store | KEEP/MODIFY | 形成稳定Payload Reference |
| IH Input FIFO/Pipeline | KEEP | 第一版优先保留donor现有结构和深度 |
| Address Mapping | MODIFY | System PA→Canonical Resource |
| Illegal Address处理 | MODIFY | Typed Reject，不静默修正 |
| TE Entry Array | KEEP/MODIFY | 保存Canonical Descriptor及Transaction Progress |
| TE Entry Generation | CONDITIONAL | 仅存在Late Reference/ABA风险时启用 |
| RD/WR发出后直接删除Entry | DELETE | 改为Logical Transaction Terminal |
| TE Page-open Shadow | DELETE AS TRUTH | 只允许Freshness可验证的Query Cache |
| Dependency | MODIFY | 区分Data/Ordering Dependency与Bank Conflict |
| Dependency Release | MODIFY | 由真实Completion Owner显式释放 |
| Same-cycle Free/Reuse | NOT REQUIRED V1 | 后续性能证明需要后再增加 |

